WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.190
Someone once said...

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.720
There are birds with combs made 
of silky green broccoli...

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.760
Broccobirds!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:06.630
There are pigs that have sweet bodies 
made of rice dumplings and bean jam...

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.140
Rice Dumpigs!

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.240
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:19.480
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.920
In order to get Meteor Garlic, 
a training ingredient,

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.850
Toriko and company went 
to the Gourmet Casino.

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.990
They played against Livebearer in 
a game of gourmet concentration,

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:32.590
called Gourmet Tasting.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.290
I'll eat it all right...

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:41.300
The Poison Potato!!!

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:43.970
I told you once.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:46.540
You had a bad eating combination.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:51.240
Through Coco's strategy, 
Livebearer was defeated.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:52.910
You lose.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.950
Fine! Enough!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.550
I don't care about the game!

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.150
So you finally show your true colors...

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:15.430
After Toriko and company beat the 
attacking Livebearer and his minions...

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:16.300
Toriko!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.270
I found it!

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.340
The ingredient you guys are looking for!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.970
Meteor Garlic, the real thing...

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:26.680
They found the Meteor Garlic at last!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:34.290
A Taste that's Out of this World! 
Eating the Meteor Garlic!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:41.990
That's...

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.030
...Meteor Garlic!

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:49.500
It's gigantic!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.600
What the hell?! You had 
the real thing right here!

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.540
Apparently, he stored it here as 
a good luck charm for the game.

00:03:56.770 --> 00:03:58.340
That's good to hear!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:02.880
Even Livebearer-san has 
love for real ingredients!

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.480
That's not why...

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.550
I'll tell you right now,

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.720
Meteor Garlic is a Special 
Preparation Ingredient.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.190
Will you be able to cook it?

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:16.130
Yes! I'll manage it somehow!

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:18.960
Alright! I'm countin' on you, Komatsu!

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.430
Right, Toriko-san!

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:22.900
And with that decided, let's 
get ready for a feast!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:33.240
A restaurant with a scenic view!

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:37.010
It's a special private room. I 
had one of my men prepare it.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.250
We've got a bird's-eye view of the casino.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:40.920
And a bunch of booze!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.720
Hey, this looks like it's 
gonna be a fantastic dinner!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.320
Let's get started with an aperitif!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:50.730
You downed a whole bottle of Summer 
Whiskey and wanna drink <i>more</i>?

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:52.860
Hey...

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.230
Is Komatsu okay alone?

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.600
Yeah.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.870
I used Knocking on Livebearer, 
so he can't move freely.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.100
Besides...

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.780
I can't peel the skin...

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.380
What should I do here?

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:21.120
You could spend the rest of your life 
pulling on it and it'd be no use.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.360
I told you. Meteor Garlic is a 
Special Preparation Ingredient.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.730
Preparing it is no simple thing...

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:27.760
I did it!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.360
I peeled a little of it!

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:34.270
The key is cutting the skin along the 
creases while toasting it with heat.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.570
H-He figured out how to 
peel it without any hints?!

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.840
And even if he knows how to peel 
it, applying just the right amount

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.980
of pressure with the knife 
takes considerable technique!

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.050
This boy...

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:49.180
He really is something special...

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:52.920
H-Huh?

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:58.120
Has the direction of the grain changed?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.360
What should I do?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.140
Livebearer-san, is there 
any Cheese Cabbage left?

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:14.170
Alright!

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.130
What in the world are you doing?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.860
I thought maybe the 
microbes in Cheese Cabbage

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:40.600
would be able to break down the tough skin.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:44.140
He heated up Cheese Cabbage

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:47.140
to just the right temperature 
to make its microbes active?!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:52.480
I'll try raising the heat a little more...

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:53.910
Three degrees...

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.280
No, maybe two degrees...

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:08.460
The skin's softer than before.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:11.460
But now what should I do?

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:21.640
The Knocking wore off...

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:26.010
How should I cut it?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.710
Like this?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.660
Here!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.300
Um...

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.330
How long has it been...

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:58.570
...since I last saw a chef do his 
very best to find a cooking method?

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.010
L-Livebearer-san...

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:04.410
It only gets harder from here on in.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:05.550
Okay!

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:25.200
Next, you have to cut 
crosswise with the knife.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:25.770
Right!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.010
Thank you for your patience!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.510
The Meteor Garlic is ready!

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.380
Way to go, Komatsu!

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.280
But what is Livebearer doing here?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:47.650
Your forte, fortune-telling? You 
saw that this was going to happen?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:50.060
I didn't need to divine the future for this.

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.390
Komatsu's passion for food

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.730
made Livebearer's heart bounce back.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.130
Coco...

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:00.830
Komatsu took the scum off of the 
soup and out of Livebearer...

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:02.100
Coco...

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:09.040
Livebearer-san, please do the honors.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:17.550
T-Teppanyaki?!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:21.190
Livebearer-san taught me how to cook it!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:24.520
What?! In the end, you 
wanted to eat it too, huh?

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.460
A real ingredient!

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.500
Be careful.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.260
It's going to burst open.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.920
The heat of the teppanyaki sent it flying!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.140
Awesome!

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.150
The clove inside is hard like a meteorite

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:24.420
and bursts forth like popcorn.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:27.220
And now it looks like a shooting 
star... like a meteor...

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:33.090
The part of the Meteor 
Garlic that you can eat

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.590
is only one section of 
the center of the clove.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:39.730
Now it's ready... Meteor Garlic...

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.200
Th-That's...

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.320
Th-That...

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.060
...Meteor Garlic?!

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.700
You have my gratitude, Livebearer!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.400
Thank you!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.110
Well, let's chow down!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:28.980
Come on!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.750
Hurry up an' sit down!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.810
Livebearer-san!

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:33.550
Are you sure?

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:35.220
Of course!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.690
It's thanks to you that we're 
able to eat it like this.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:41.060
Besides, food tastes better when 
you eat it together, right?

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:42.760
Toriko-chan...

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.690
Okay...

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:48.830
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.360
Let's eat!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:55.870
This is all we can eat from 
that giant garlic bulb...

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:58.340
Just how much nutrition is packed in here?

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:00.610
What's this?!

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:04.240
Wha...?! Komatsu, what 
happened to your body?!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.650
Right after I ate the Meteor Garlic, 
I got all muscular like this.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.250
Like I figured...

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.020
After all, word is that after eating it, 
you can go a month without sleeping!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.590
You too?!

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:20.660
The outside has the texture 
of a fried potato.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:23.600
The inside like moist cream cheese...

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.630
It's been so long that I'd forgotten

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:29.740
the joy of savoring delicious food!

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.040
You got even bigger!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:36.180
Watching Komatsu-chan made me 
realize that I've lost my edge.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:39.950
It looks like you've remembered how 
much fun food can be, Livebearer.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.480
Coco! Coco? Are you Coco?

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.550
I guess Meteor Garlic is an ingredient 
that's compatible with me.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:49.050
My cells have evolved.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:50.520
That's too much evolution!

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.860
Livebearer...

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:54.260
Why don't you go back to being a chef?

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.200
A <i>decent</i> chef...

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.930
I agree!

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:01.670
You've got super-duper 
skills, Livebearer-san!

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:02.800
Komatsu-chan...

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.100
You got that right!

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:10.780
Delicious...

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.340
This is delicious...

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:16.850
Meteor Garlic...

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.990
You're the best, Livebearer!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.360
You're totally macho too, Toriko-san!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:29.460
All I did was teach 
Komatsu-chan how to cook it.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.160
Also, Gourmet Mafia-san...

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.600
I'm going to turn the casino over to you.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:39.900
And you can scrap or do what you 
want with the illegal ingredients.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:40.500
You...

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.950
Thank you for the food!

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:56.250
Meteor Garlic was so good...

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:59.120
I think it would've been even more delicious

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:01.760
accompanied by Poison Potato,

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:05.060
but I didn't know how to get the poison out.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:07.060
I'll have to work on that problem...

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.900
I know how to do it.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:11.570
You know?!

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:15.970
Or to be precise, I know a 
man who knows how to do it.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:19.380
The method to completely remove all 
of the poison from a Poison Potato...

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.780
Really?!

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:23.610
Yes. In fact, Coco...

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.810
I'm sure he has information on

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:29.120
that ingredient you wanted 
to know about, Atom.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:32.020
Who is he?

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:36.330
The personal chef to the king of Jiddal...

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:38.830
Joie.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.830
No one knows who he really is.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.530
But he's called the Dark Chef.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:48.770
He should be in the royal 
palace, far west of here.

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:04.220
A Rose Oyster, Your Highness.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.490
Throw this sow into the dungeon.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.090
D-Did I say anything rude, Your Highness?!

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:17.230
You didn't put a drop of Rose 
Lemon on the Rose Oyster!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.330
I-I'm terribly sorry!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.300
Please forgive me!

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.700
All of you can leave, too.

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:34.810
King of Jiddal, Darnil Kahn

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.950
Damn you, Livebearer...

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.980
You blew it.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:42.220
The casino has gathered an 
abundance of ingredients.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.830
I would say he's done well up until now.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:49.800
Still and all, he's sold out to some guests.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:52.700
Joie, Personal Chef to the King of Jiddal

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.300
Right, Joie?

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:58.600
I believe the king knows everything 
that goes on at the casino.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.340
So you'd better steel yourselves.

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:04.540
The palace of the notoriously evil despot...

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:07.380
We don't know what he's capable of.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:11.080
But I have a feeling that no matter 
what happens tonight, we'll be alright!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.750
You're not the Komatsu I know!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:20.190
We never did share any important 
information with Livebearer.

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:24.230
And there aren't any crucial memories 
in storage at the casino either.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.730
I see...

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.600
Then we have no more use 
for this country either...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.900
Correct.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:34.470
I've already informed everyone in 
the palace and they're moving on it.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:37.910
I expected heavy security, 
but there's nobody here.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.180
Yeah. Something's fishy...

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.780
Anyway, this place is huge...

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.480
It's not far behind the Gourmet Pyramid.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:50.190
That's because the king keeps most 
of the earnings from the casino.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.160
It was simple for him to have 
a palace like this constructed.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:55.290
Not just the casino...

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:59.300
I'm sure he made about 50 times more from 
underground commerce than the casino.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:03.930
And we've amassed a decent amount of 
funds. So I believe the time is right.

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.970
Our plan is in its final stage as well.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:08.840
Also...

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:13.640
...in order to get to that place, 
the notebook is necessary.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:18.150
The secret notebook that the Gourmet God 
Acacia is said to have left behind...

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.880
And we know where it is...

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.560
That's the king's room.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:33.230
Then let's get a little face time.

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.800
We already know where the notebook is.

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:46.210
For our information network far exceeds 
that of IGO and Gourmet Corp...

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:49.580
Now that you mention IGO and Gourmet Corp...

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:54.180
...we have reports that their top 
leaders have made contact recently.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.920
That's very curious...

00:17:56.920 --> 00:17:59.320
Would you tell me more 
over a drink and snacks?

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.390
In good time.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:04.060
It seems that Toriko and his party 
will arrive here in moments.

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.530
They're looking for me, apparently.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.100
It's a pain, so I'm going to take a powder.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:14.940
And you, my liege, the Robo Engine...

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:17.610
I see...

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:22.580
In that case, I suppose 
I shall return, too...

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.520
We're comin' in!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:39.060
Uh... Nobody's here!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.600
It looks like they've left long ago...

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.140
I don't sense any electromagnetic waves.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.070
I don't think anyone's 
still in the royal palace.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.070
Then the king abandoned his country...

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.610
But why would a dictator with access 
to the highest quality ingredients

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.250
ditch his country?

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:05.150
My guess is he found a place where he 
can eat food that's even more delicious.

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:06.720
Joie, huh?

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:08.790
I wanted to meet him...

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.740
It's morning.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.040
Quiet...

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:24.170
Well?

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.270
Have you made the preparations?

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.910
Yes, Sensei.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:34.750
You've done a wonderful job freezing it.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.680
That's my Nono!

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:42.150
The Special Preparation Ingredient,

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:44.120
Ice Ginger,

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.730
needs to be kept at -20 degrees

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:50.290
and cut up quickly or it's no good.

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:01.910
IGO, huh?

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.410
I thought you would show 
up one of these days.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:10.150
I know the reason you've come for me.

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.950
It seems your president

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.490
and the boss of Gourmet Corp.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.620
have met!

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:29.100
In those younger days,

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:31.000
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:35.570
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:38.910
After that, time passed

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.380
Were you able to grasp

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:46.020
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:49.720
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:54.960
You turn into a coward,

00:20:56.260 --> 00:21:00.430
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:05.300
So now's the time!

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:12.970
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:17.210
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:20.280
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:24.120
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.920
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:31.630
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:36.100
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:39.500
Please choose one of these three platters.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:44.340
This week's lucky ingredient is in one of them!


00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:48.110
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:50.510
Here we go!

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:52.910
A heaping helping...

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.220
Open!

00:21:57.150 --> 00:21:59.590
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:08.630
A - Regal Mammoth Capture Level 48

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.390
...yours if you chose A!

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:06.130
There are lots of fun things 
in store for you this week!

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.630
You may be smiling all week long!

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:18.270
C - Crystal Cola Capture Level 19

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:12.800
If you chose C, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:15.870
You might find a hint to success 
in the pages of a book!

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:18.270
Your lucky place is a library!

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:28.550
B - Crab Pig Capture Level 8

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:22.110
And I'm sorry. If you chose B, you're third.

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:23.780
Are you kind of worn out?

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.580
Early to bed, early to rise, and 
you'll be fit as a fiddle in no time!

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:28.310
It might even improve your luck!

00:22:28.980 --> 00:22:32.550
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.250
Are you ready?

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:37.190
One of Toriko's friends will 
appear with some words of wisdom.

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:42.730
Good Luck Charm Photo Time


00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:39.490
If you take a photo of the scene,

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:42.760
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:43.230 --> 00:22:44.600
Alright, here we go!

00:22:45.160 --> 00:22:47.500
3... 2... 1...

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:48.930
Scoop chance!

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:51.340
This week too,

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.540
be sure to make

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:56.910
delicious memories!

00:22:58.740 --> 00:23:02.910
Alright, make delicious memories right now!

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:04.550
Here's next week's preview!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.450
Maximum intensity!

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:10.840
The head of IGO and the boss of Gourmet Corp.

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:13.460
It's a battle over the legendary ingredient, GOD.

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:17.190
Showdown at the Summit! Ichiryu Versus Midora of the Gourmet Corp.!

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:19.050
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
